      {
        "id": "the-whole-disaster-started-with-a-sudden-knocking-noise-and-white-smoke",
        "title": "The whole disaster started with a sudden knocking noise and white smoke.",
        "description": "The driver reported a loud knocking noise and massive white smoke from the exhaust. The engine lost power immediately. The van was recovered to a Mercedes commercial specialist.",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "src": "/case-studies/assets/1.2-mercedes-sprinter-injector-cost-comparison.png",
            "alt": "Visual comparison showing £60 injector that destroyed a £4,000 Mercedes OM651 engine",
            "width": "",
            "height": ""
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "What fleet owner thought"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "“Probably a failed injector”"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "A few hundred quid and back on the road."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "What it actually was"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Injector tip detached"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "The metal tip bounced between piston and head, destroying cylinder three."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Why it matters"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Engine replacement"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Once the bore is scored, the block is scrap. A replacement engine is the only option."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "If your OM651 develops a sudden knocking noise and white smoke, stop driving immediately. An injector tip failure can destroy the engine within seconds. Book a specialist inspection immediately."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Failure timeline"
          }
        ],
